 \\times 20) + (73 \\times 4)\n   \\]\n   \n2. **Calculate each part:**\n   - \\( 73 \\times 20 = 1,\\!460 \\)\n   - \\( 73 \\times 4 = 292 \\)\n   \n3. **Sum the results:**\n   \\[\n   1,\\!460 + 292 = 1,\\!752\n   \\]\n\n**Verification:**\n- Alternative method: \\( 70 \\times 24 = 1,\\!680 \\) and \\( 3 \\times 24 = 72 \\). Adding these gives \\( 1,\\!680 + 72 = 1,\\!752 \\).\n\n**Final Answer:**  \nThe product of 73 and 24 is \\boxed{1752}.",
