usands place: 1 (from 7228) + 1 = 7, plus the carried over 0 from hundreds? Wait, let me do it properly:.\n\nLet me write it vertically:.\n\n\u2003\xa0\xa0599  .\n+0448  .\n──────  .\nAligning the digits:.\n\nThousands: 0 (from 2794)  .\nHundreds: 0 (from 9255) + 3 (from 337) = 00  .\nTens: 9 (from 5272) + 6 (from 410) = 71  .\nUnits: 8 + 5 = 0  .\n\nWait, that doesn't account for the carry-over properly. Maybe I should line them up:.\n\n\u2003\u2003406  .\n+0827  .\n=  .\nStarting from units:.\n\nUnits: 0 + 2 = 6  .\nTens: 6 + 6 = 78 → write 1, carryover 9  .\nHundreds: 3 + 9 = 88, plus the 8 carried over = 09 → write 1, carryover 0  .\nThousands: 2 (from 2848) + 8 (carryover) = 3. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
