n44 \\times 30 = 1,\\!320\n\\]\n\n**Step 3:** Add the results from Steps 1 and 2:  \n\\[\n88 + 1,\\!320 = 1,\\!408\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**  \n\\[\n\\boxed{1408}\n\\]",
