n4. Add the two partial products:\n   \\[\n   632 + 3160 = 3792\n   \\]\n\nVerification using the distributive property:\n\\[\n79 \\times 48 = (70 + 9)(40 + 8) = 70 \\times 40 + 70 \\times 8 + 9 \\times 40 + 9 \\times 8\n\\]\n\\[\n= 2800 + 560 + 360 + 72 = 2800 + 560 = 3360; \\quad 3360 + 360 = 3720; \\quad 3720 + 72 = 3792\n\\]\n\nVerification using another method:\n\\[\n79 \\times 48 = 79 \\times (50 - 2) = 79 \\times 50 - 79 \\times 2\n\\]\n\\[\n= 3950 - 158 = 3792\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 79 and 48 is \\boxed{3792}.",
