\n```\n\nBreaking it down:\n1. Multiply 87 by 1 (ones place): **87**\n2. Multiply 87 by 40 (tens place): **3480**\n3. Add the results: **87 + 3480 = 3567**\n\n**Final Answer:**  \nThe product of 87 and 41 is \\boxed{3567}.",
