duct of 51 and 73 is \\boxed{3723}.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of 51 and 73, we can break down the multiplication into smaller parts for easier calculation:\n\n1. Multiply 51 by 70:\n   \\[\n   51 \\times 70 = 51 \\times 7 \\times 10 = 357 \\times 10 = 3570\n   \\]\n\n2. Multiply 51 by 3:\n   \\[\n   51 \\times 3 = 153\n   \\]\n\n3. Add the results of the two multiplications:\n   \\[\n   3570 + 153 = 3723\n   \\]\n\nTo verify, we can use another method by breaking down 51 into 50 and 1:\n1. Multiply 50 by 73:\n   \\[\n   50 \\times 73 = 3650\n   \\]\n\n2. Multiply 1 by 73:\n   \\[\n   1 \\times 73 = 73\n   \\]\n\n3. Add the results:\n   \\[\n   3650 + 73 = 3723\n   \\]\n\nBoth methods confirm that the product of 51 and 73 is \\(\\boxed{3723}\\).",
