d using the distributive property:\n- Break down the numbers: \\(88 \\times 93 = (80 + 8) \\times (90 + 3)\\)\n- Expand and calculate each term:\n  \\[\n  \\begin{align*}\n  80 \\times 90 &= 7200, \\\\\n  80 \\times 3 &= 240, \\\\\n  8 \\times 90 &= 720, \\\\\n  8 \\times 3 &= 24.\n  \\end{align*}\n  \\]\n- Sum all terms:\n  \\[\n  7200 + 240 + 720 + 24 = 8184\n  \\]\n\nBoth methods confirm that the product of 88 and 93 is \\(\\boxed{8184}\\).",
