75 into 25 * 3):\n1. **Calculate 19 * 25**:\n   \\[\n   19 \\times 25 = 475\n   \\]\n2. **Multiply the result by 3**:\n   \\[\n   475 \\times 3 = 1425\n   \\]\n\nBoth methods confirm the result. Therefore, the product of 19 and 75 is \\(\\boxed{1425}\\).",
