y:\n\\[\n24 \\times (40 - 3) = 24 \\times 40 - 24 \\times 3\n\\]\n\\[\n= 960 - 72 = 888\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 24 and 37 is \\(\\boxed{888}\\).",
