ts together:\n\n\\[\n4900 + 490 = 5390\n\\]\n\nTo verify, we can also use another method by recognizing that 98 is close to 100:\n\n\\[\n98 \\times 55 = (100 - 2) \\times 55\n\\]\n\nApply the distributive property:\n\n\\[\n100 \\times 55 - 2 \\times 55 = 5500 - 110 = 5390\n\\]\n\nBoth methods confirm that the product of 98 and 55 is \\(\\boxed{5390}\\).",
