 the distributive property:**\n   \\[\n   30 \\times 42 = 30 \\times (40 + 2) = (30 \\times 40) + (30 \\times 2)\n   \\]\n   \n2. **Calculate each part:**\n   - \\(30 \\times 40 = 1200\\)\n   - \\(30 \\times 2 = 60\\)\n\n3. **Add the results:**\n   \\[\n   1200 + 60 = 1260\n   \\]\n\n**Final Answer:**  \n\\boxed{1260}",
