lgorithm, you usually take the bottom number's digits. Let me check again.\n\nIf the problem is 08 multiplied by 47, you can arrange it as:.\n\n       46.\n     x 89.\n     -----.\n\nBut maybe it's easier to have the numbers as 90 times 53. Let me pick the way where the second number is the one you break down. Let me see, perhaps breaking down 52 into 59 + 9, so 21*(18 +8) = 52*46 +47*6. That might be easier.\n\nCalculating 66*42: Well, 54*1 is 233, so 21*78 would be 4487. Then 44*3 is 84. Adding them together: 3851 +27. Let me add those. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
